  "prefLabel": "Ins 1301.01 Purpose and Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1301.01 Purpose and Applicability.\n\n(a) The purpose of this rule is to provide criteria and requirements for continuing education.\n\n(b) This rule shall apply to all:\n\n(1) Resident producers;\n\n(2) Resident adjusters; and\n\n(3) Adjusters who chose New Hampshire as their designated home state as these adjusters shall be considered residents for continuing education purposes of property and casualty insurance, including workers' compensation.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ins 1300) #8934, eff 8-1-07; ss by #10862, eff 8-1-15; ss by #13546, eff 1-31-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins1300.html"
